      "prompt_version": "lean-to-tex-v3-strict-context-free-semantic-inputs",
      "tex_statement": "If $2\\le K<N$, $expect$ is a finite linear expectation, $argmaxRule$ is pointwise maximizing for every observed dataset, and expected 0-1 accuracy equals expected posterior score for each coordinate and choice rule, then every decision rule has expected accuracy at most that of $argmaxRule$.",
